; MITEMSHUB AI v23.0 - Volatility 75 AGGRO profile
; Regenerated 2026-08-27 with ALL v23 intelligence & safety upgrades.
;
; KEY v23 FIXES vs v22:
;   1. TRAILING + BREAKEVEN RE-ENABLED — the #1 killer was both OFF
;   2. MaxConsecLoss lowered 6 -> 3 — stop sooner, preserve capital
;   3. CoolDownBars raised 1 -> 3 — don't re-enter immediately after loss
;   4. MaxHoldBars raised 14 -> 20 — give trades room to reach TP
;   5. MaxEffectiveRiskPct lowered 35 -> 20 — tighter per-trade risk cap
;   6. MaxDailyLossPct lowered 0.35 -> 0.05 — 5% daily halt, not 35%
;   7. MaxTotalRiskPct lowered 50 -> 15 — sane fleet exposure
;   8. TrailDistR tightened 0.9 -> 0.7 — lock profit sooner
;   9. Graduated exit, profit lock, session filter, volume scaling ON
;
; z=1.0 = deepest VALIDATED gate on real ticks (~7 trades/day)
; Magic 7788075 — fleet exposure guard compliant.
